{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-08_beg",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-08",
  "title": "換一個角度",
  "storyCode": "6-9",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0ba755c84fe4a05a19fc31aaaee55421dfaff787dd645df714e11d5c286854a6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "可我們並不熟這裡的構造，我害怕......感染者會針對我們行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "放心，我很熟悉這裡。聽我的指揮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "Yes sir！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "陳sir，有個不太好的消息。根據各處的通報，整合運動的行動又變得有條理了起來，就像重新找到了指揮官一樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "他們......他們還調整了既有頻道，重置了加密，我們沒法再追蹤他們的通訊了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......難道他們和貧民區裡的隊伍會合了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "不可能，我已經收到消息說羅德島處理好了貧民區裡的事情，這才讓我們得以不被裡外夾擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "奇怪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "阿陳，我準備——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "通訊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "“小姐”，麻煩你去那邊等我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "你怎麼每次時間都卡這麼準非要在我有事找你的時候有事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "線人連上了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你快去。下次給你買鱗魚蛋吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "你當我小孩嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......我是陳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有新的整合運動成員從貧民區下層過來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "被稱作是雪怪小隊的感染者，似乎有毀壞建築物、摧毀城市基礎結構的能力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "務必小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Only-1，有隸屬龍門的特殊部隊在貧民區活動。我們還暫時沒法阻止他們。你要注意安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......Only-1，之前為什麼沒有發送定時通信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在想一些事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在我想清楚了，龍門就拜託你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "什麼？我不理解你的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在的我，早已經不再屬於這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Only-1！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會帶一些龍門的感染者走。近衛局沒法保護他們，這座城市不在乎他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或者說，即使你是這麼想的，這座城市也並不如你所願。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "九！服從命令！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......三年前起，我就不屬於近衛局了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再說，原本，理應是我命令你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "九......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說的特殊部隊，我似乎已經看見過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還是把龍門想像得太好了。再見，陳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對了，別去檢查排水系統。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我聲音是不是太大了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那確實特別大，我感覺一條街都聽見了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "怎麼也沒你的嗓門大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，阿陳，你過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "坐啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "Miss詩懷雅居然不顧形象、不怕裙子髒，就這樣子蹲坐在街邊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "無所謂啦！你怎麼覺得我會在意那種事的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "......我準備再給那隻下水道老鼠打個電話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "雖然我沒怎麼來過這裡，但我覺得特殊部隊一定在做可怕的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你見過貧民區的林嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "我見過。是個很和善的老人，比我爺爺好多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......他可是“鼠王”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "這幾個人不都這樣。但他真的是個好人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "我只是沒想到雨霞她會變成現在這個樣子。明明以前是個又膽小又靦腆的孩子，經常躲在你背後來著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我倒覺得她沒有變。她只是......擔負起了責任。也許並不該屬於她的責任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "就算你這麼提醒她，也沒用。我們已經被架在火上烤了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "她和她父親的事情，我也沒有頭緒。只不過，她不會是那種冷血的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "所以我想再打個電話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "也許剛才的消息可以幫到我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "怎麼說的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "一支有著特殊能力的整合運動力量進入了貧民區，他們甚至能指揮現在的整合運動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "這個消息只有我知道。現在，只有我們兩個知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "你打算怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "把雨披引向他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "除了留在外面和近衛局一起清理特殊感染者的，不少特殊部隊已經和我們同時進入了貧民區。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "就算這樣，我們也依然不知道他們的力量分佈，也沒法防範他們，不知道他們會做出什麼事來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "但你可以透過林雨霞，把他們引到這支整合運動小隊那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "逼他們出來？讓所有近衛局的成員都看見？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "讓所有近衛局的成員都看見。甚至，讓羅德島也看見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "你現在這麼信任他們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "他們比我見過的任何人都專注於自己的目標，比近衛局還要誠實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我們也沒有什麼可以信任的人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "你膽子真大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "龍門人不知道什麼林，不怎麼認識你的祖父，也不太清楚魏彥吾是誰，更別說底下那些商會什麼的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "龍門人只相信近衛局。這幾個人沒有人敢冒風險真的抹除龍門近衛局，只留下普通警力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "再加上外人......這個秤砣會重到他們不敢接手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "你會被撤職哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "也挺好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "那就痛快做完這最後一班活吧！下次，我要讓他們把巡邏路線排進貧民區。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "林會不會接受？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "只要我們能保下這裡，林肯定接受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "對了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你知不知道我們有三位客人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_036",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_036",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "臭老鼠，有個消息給你。有支整合運動，我們現在擋不住，需要你那支隊伍的幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_036",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......怎麼可能？不要騙我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我騙過你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_036",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你和我說要和我上同一所中學，結果你去了維多利亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對不起。實在對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_036",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒什麼，我不在意了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雨霞，你爸為龍門做了很多。我們不想失去這裡，這裡的居民也不能失去我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_036",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "騙子。你會來這裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_036",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你會來貧民區嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......陳會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_036",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你還真不會騙人啊。她，關我什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你爸出於一些原因，不能夠直接著手調解普通人和感染者的矛盾，但陳會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "陳和你的父親一起調理著貧民區。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們在努力讓貧民區變成一個可以讓更多人生活的地方，甚至是甩掉貧民區這個名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你想......雖然龍門的普通市民很少居住在這，但是過去這些年裡，他們不也經常來這裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再過一些時間，我們就不需要貧民區了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_036",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然感染者的問題我們還沒法解決，但我相信......這裡可以變成一個更好的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是龍門的22到29下城區，而不是什麼“貧民區”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個城市本來就是因為能容納許許多多、各種各樣的人，才發展成現在這個樣子的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "龍門不能失去任何人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_036",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......無聊。你變得和那個陳一樣無聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雨霞......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，我不想把氣氛搞得像是垃圾終端連續劇一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_036",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那支整合運動的位置在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_036",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不會說第二次的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿米婭，你們已經進入貧民區了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在的情況十分特殊。你們應該知情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
